      "value": "some people are already using the string loader to load additional assets\n\nthe world \"auto splatter\" is one example of some mesh and textures being loaded. \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_42b2a094-a0ec-42fa-81e7-b5e99fa74ef2/info\n\n3D Loader Tablet Demo world （WIP）, is another example\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a74abb7d-a423-44bb-a7ea-3bc5e8281dde/info\n\ni think how to best use such a feature needs to be considered. especially for quest headsets. the main thing is there is only so much ram on those things\n\nthe other concern i have is that when a vrchat world is abandoned right now, it still works. but if worlds start relying on external content, then worlds will fall apart faster when the server holding the information is not maintained",
