  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This would make VRC worlds capable of being gigantic. Allow VRChat world creators to dynamically stream non-code 3D asset bundles, models, and textures over HTTP requests at runtime (similar to current VRCStringDownloader / VRCImageDownloader mechanics). This would allow large-scale worldbuilders—especially those targetting standalone mobile devices (Meta Quest)—to bypass static world file size limits and create expansive, seamless open-world environments.",
